        data-is-internal="true"> <div class="p-vertical-positioning p-text-container  p-valign-top"> <div class="p-text-container-inner"> <p class="p-body-text p-text-smaller
                        p-l-col1 p-m-col1
                        p-s-col1 p-xs-col1"> <span><p><strong>Philips Museum&nbsp;</strong></p> <p>Emmasingel 31&nbsp;</p> <p>5611 AZ Eindhoven</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Receptie</strong></p> <p>+31 (0)40 235 90&nbsp;30&nbsp;</p> <p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#3b52555d5416564e485e4e567b4b535257524b4815585456" data-track-description="info_museum_philips_com" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-compid="gc11" class="p-gc11v3-inlinelink"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="c5acaba3aae8a8b0b6a0b0a885b5adaca9acb5b6eba6aaa8">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Boekingen &amp; Sales&nbsp;</strong></p> <p>+31 (0)40 235 90 30</p> <p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#92f0fdf7f9fbfcf5f7fcbfffe7e1f7e7ffd2e2fafbfefbe2e1bcf1fdff" data-track-description="boekingen_museum_philips_com" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-compid="gc11" class="p-gc11v3-inlinelink"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="61030e040a080f06040f4c0c141204140c211109080d0811124f020e0c">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Pers</strong></p> <p><a href="https://www.philips.nl/a-w/philips-museum/pers.html" data-track-description="Pers_&amp;_media" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-compid="gc11" class="p-gc11v3-inlinelink">Pers &amp; media</a></p> <p>+31 (0)6 15 89 14 42</p> <p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#6a090507071f0403090b1e0305041947071f190f1f072a1a020306031a1944090507" data-track-description="communications_museum_philips_com" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-compid="gc11" class="p-gc11v3-inlinelink"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="c5a6aaa8a8b0abaca6a4b1acaaabb6e8a8b0b6a0b0a885b5adaca9acb5b6eba6aaa8">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p></span> </p> </div> </div> </section> </div> </div> </section> </div> </div> <div class="p-grid-item 
                                           
                                           
